# Dry-run artefacts. Every handler here writes its output to the CWD on a local
# run (localrun / dbFlag=False), so running one from this folder leaves files
# behind. None of them is a committed golden reference: they carry live market
# data and change daily. The shapes a healthy dry run produces are recorded in
# doc/OPERATIONS.md instead.
